  "claim_boundary": "Phase 7 packages Operator V6 as a private per-user Windows universal-knowledge and adversarial-capability experiment. It adds a content-addressed multidisciplinary graph spanning fifteen declared disciplines while keeping causal experience records separate. The seed proves domain-level coverage, provenance, epistemic separation, immutable retrieval, transaction binding, and citation-grounded rendering; it is not exhaustive human knowledge. The language model still cannot execute, grant permission, promote its output into knowledge, or write Atom memory. Every tool action still requires explicit approval of one exact manifest. The shell preserves verified model provisioning, opt-in updates, SHA-256 verification, staged replacement, rollback, and real artifact side views. This does not claim that prompt injection is solved, unattended production autonomy is safe, medical output is clinical advice, cloud tool execution is enabled, or external publishing is authorized."
